{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2376", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2376/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2376/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2376/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2376", "id": 2471843848, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6TVVgI", "number": 2376, "title": "Issue with action.terminate() in terminate.cpp example with SITL", "user": {"login": "KarthiAru", "id": 8588253, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODgyNTM=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8588253?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru", "html_url": "https://github.com/KarthiAru", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2024-08-18T07:52:33Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-19T04:34:20Z", "closed_at": "2024-08-19T04:34:19Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nI am currently working with the [terminate.cpp](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/examples/terminate/terminate.cpp) example in SITL using gazebo and the gazebo_typhoon_h480 models. I am encountering an issue where the `action.terminate()` function does not seem to work as expected.\r\n\r\n**Expected Behavior:**\r\n-  `action.terminate()` should disarm the drone and open the parachute, causing the drone's altitude to decrease and the drone to disarm.\r\n\r\n**Actual Behavior:**\r\n-  The `action.terminate()` function does not result in the drone disarming or deploying the parachute. The altitude remains unchanged, and I receive an error message related to a poll timeout.\r\n-  The `action.kill()` function, on the other hand, works as intended, causing the drone\u2019s altitude to drop to 0 and the drone to disarm.\r\n\r\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\r\n- Launch SITL `make px4_sitl gazebo` or `make px4_sitl gazebo_typhoon_h480`\r\n- Launch QGroundcontrol\r\n- [Optional] Set COM_PARACHUTE param\r\n- Initiate Takeoff (Wait till the drone reaches 10m and transitions to HOLD mode).\r\n- Execute the terminate.cpp program.\r\n\r\nLog: [https://review.px4.io/plot_app?log=a7744711-82ea-42ae-9be7-6bc1f615d787](https://review.px4.io/plot_app?log=a7744711-82ea-42ae-9be7-6bc1f615d787) _(Note: I triggered RTL at the end for the purpose of saving the log file.)_\r\n\r\nI have also attempted to enable the parameter COM_PARACHUTE, but the issue persists. Are there additional parameters or configurations required to ensure `action.terminate()` functions correctly?", "closed_by": {"login": "KarthiAru", "id": 8588253, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODgyNTM=", "av